<section #sh-book-part-title | `<book-part-title>`>

<sub-section | General Usage>

Semantic role: *book-part-title*. Compiles to eHTML `<book-part-title>`.

Registers:

- Canonical: `<book-part-title>`

<section #sh-book-subtitle | `<book-subtitle>`>

<sub-section | General Usage>

Semantic role: *book-subtitle*. Compiles to eHTML `<book-subtitle>`.

Registers:

